      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我思考了一下。她已经具备足以出战GI比赛的素质，\r\n草地2000米的比赛条件也非常适合她。\r\n但更关键的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d8b682896ed74f0f2df9ef5877bfdc0ae937a7f48b5d2e4fa2b351843821d52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
