    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae6264cd08cc77b3076311f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自盯着我的爱慕织姬的双眼中，\r\n我感受到无可比之的坚定意志。\r\n这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aedce1384cfdccc0ef6c4d3d930e25a27e0aa617b7f5b82488f8783af1f13511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
