      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将抵达第四弯道！\n能够率先拔群而出的会是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "763f6c66e62ec7aa0ac4ac09da839607f728885a4d5b89679309b5f37b354e27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
