      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就决定了。\r\n……下次比赛，就是『希望锦标。』",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd78078e11b25b0d10a60cb5991e45a960148b7737b490b9d307f5410ebef2a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158d3b7326be86b859ef9b08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我们将接下来的比赛目标定为\r\n新马级新星群聚的『希望锦标』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94724f5e44de06c5aff3f19719b59340f6aa6ec598c8b1d249172725d1350e2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c2987dcfd2d6c1db2bacf7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
